OpenAI’s GPT-6.1 Terra model is now available through Netlify’s AI Gateway and Agent Runners with zero configuration required.

Use the OpenAI SDK directly in your Netlify Functions without managing API keys or authentication. AI Gateway handles everything automatically. Here’s an example using GPT-6.1 Terra with the Responses API:

import OpenAI from 'openai';

export default async () => {
    const openai = new OpenAI();

    const response = await openai.responses.create({
        model: 'gpt

