Anthropic’s Claude Haiku 5.5 model is now available through Netlify’s AI Gateway and Agent Runners with zero configuration required.

Use the Anthropic SDK directly in your Netlify Functions without managing API keys or authentication. AI Gateway handles everything automatically. Here’s an example using Claude Haiku 5.5 with the Messages API:

